 Messages exist in English (`en`) and Korean (`ko`), in
 `src/i18n/messages.js`. The server answers in `LARDER_LANG` (default `en`).
+
+## Sites
+
+Requests select a site with `X-Larder-Site`; omitting the header selects
+`main`. Header names are case insensitive. An unknown site returns HTTP 400
+with code `unknown_site`.
+
+Batches (including direct reads and waste), stock on hand, cooking, alerts,
+stock value and stock-takes use only locations belonging to the selected
+site. Cross-site batch ids return `unknown_batch`; cross-site stock-take
+ids return `not_found`, and cross-site locations return `unknown_location`.
+Order receipts must use locations in the selected site. Items, suppliers,
+recipes and dishes are shared; item responses include site-specific stock.
