+
+## Request sites
+
+The HTTP handler validates `X-Larder-Site` and passes a `store.forSite(site)`
+context to routes. This context shares records, id sequences and persistence
+with the original store; its site is local to the request. Domain stock
+operations use `inSite` to resolve ownership through locations. Unscoped
+stores used by tools retain their view across all sites.
