+## Sites (schema 3)
+
+- `sites` lists kitchens as `{ id, name }`. Every location has a `site`
+  referencing a site id. Batches and stock-takes belong to that site through
+  their location; they do not duplicate the site field.
+- Migrating schema 2 creates `main` ("Main kitchen") and assigns every
+  existing location to it. Schema 1 files migrate through schema 2 first.
